             role 2's m_e mechanism to an exact dilation (D18)

===============================================================================
VERDICT
===============================================================================

  Role 1 needed only detectability and it does not have it.  The
  displacement is ultralocal, so it is not an address but a contact
  readout of local density; nuclear matter already holds one
  398 (H1) or 114 (H2) times over threshold and nothing outside
  the nucleus sees it; and the one source that would work is read by
  an ordinary gravimeter twenty-three orders further out.  The Th-229
  courier is eight orders better than the stationary channel and
  changes nothing, because the gap it must close grows as
  sqrt(rho)/ln(rho) and diverges.  REFUTED, NOT PRICED.

